      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我一个人看电影去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I went to the movies by myself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "女解说员在煤油灯下读着说明书。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A female narrator was reading the program notes under a kerosene lamp.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我旋即走出来，返回旅馆。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I soon came back out and returned to the inn.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我把胳膊肘支在窗台上，久久地远眺着街市的夜景。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I propped my elbows on the windowsill and gazed for a long time at the nighttime view of the town.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这是黑暗的街市。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was a dark town.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我觉得远方不断隐约地传来鼓声。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I felt as though the faint sound of drums kept drifting in from far away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00990",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不知怎的，我的眼泪扑簌簌地滚落了下来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For some reason, tears came tumbling down my face.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
